From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 13:40:47 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: pmk8850: Add PWM controller

Describe the PWM block of the PMK8850, which is compatible with the
PMK8550 PWM, so that boards can use it, for example for a display
backlight. As for the PMK8550, the node is disabled by default; a board
enables it and routes the output to a PMIC GPIO.

Assisted-by: Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pmk8850.dtsi | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pmk8850.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pmk8850.dtsi
index c7ba72fd48b..053ae42ef0f 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pmk8850.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pmk8850.dtsi
@@ -66,5 +66,15 @@ reboot_reason: reboot-reason@48 {
 				bits = <1 7>;
 			};
 		};
+
+		pmk8850_pwm: pwm {
+			compatible = "qcom,pmk8850-pwm", "qcom,pmk8550-pwm";
+
+			#address-cells = <1>;
+			#size-cells = <0>;
+			#pwm-cells = <2>;
+
+			status = "disabled";
+		};
 	};
 };
-- 
